# What the root .gitignore does not already cover. The build goes under the
# root's build/ and bin/ since 2026-09-14, so nothing about objects or binaries
# is here.

# What programs/ember writes: assembly, and the binaries cc makes of it
*.s
*.out

# What the compiler writes: Solveig source and its map; the .sob after it is
# the root's rule
*.sol
*.sol.map

# Yours, not the repository's -- comments, thoughts and experiments
scratch/
